---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Andorra Private | Europe’s most private high-altitude address"
  description="Discover life in Andorra — a refined mountain principality offering privacy, favourable residency options, and exceptional quality of life."
  path="/"
  overlayNav={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-label">The Principality</div>
      <h1>Europe’s most private<br />high-altitude address</h1>
      <p>
        A refined mountain principality for those who value discretion, space,
        and a quieter form of luxury.
      </p>
      <a href="/become-a-resident" class="hero-cta">Become a Resident</a>
      <a href="/directory" class="hero-cta secondary">The directory</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why" id="lifestyle">
    <div class="why-header">
      <h2>Why Andorra</h2>
      <p>
        Not another alpine resort town. A sovereign principality with genuine
        privacy, remarkable quality of life, and a scale that still feels human.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-number">01</div>
        <h3>True Privacy</h3>
        <p>
          One of Europe’s most discreet jurisdictions. A place where wealth does
          not need to announce itself.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-number">02</div>
        <h3>Mountain Living</h3>
        <p>
          Dramatic Pyrenean landscape with exceptional air quality, outdoor
          access, and a slower daily rhythm.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-number">03</div>
        <h3>Favourable Framework</h3>
        <p>
          Attractive residency options, political stability, and a clear path for
          long-term living. Always confirm current rules with
          <a href="https://www.govern.ad/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
            >Govern.ad</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-number">04</div>
        <h3>Human Scale</h3>
        <p>
          Small enough to feel personal, sophisticated enough to feel complete.
          No crowds, no noise.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="life" id="living">
    <div class="life-header">
      <h2>Life in the Principality</h2>
      <p>
        Four seasons of mountain living, refined rather than extreme. A place
        designed for both ambition and recovery.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="life-grid">
      <div class="life-card">
        <div class="life-label">Winter</div>
        <h3>Quiet slopes &amp; sharp air</h3>
        <p>
          World-class skiing without the chaos of the bigger Alpine resorts.
          Crisp mornings, empty runs, and long evenings by the fire.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="life-card">
        <div class="life-label">Summer</div>
        <h3>High meadows &amp; long light</h3>
        <p>
          Hiking, trail running, and quiet terraces overlooking the Pyrenees.
          Warm days, cool nights, and exceptional outdoor living.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="life-card">
        <div class="life-label">Everyday</div>
        <h3>Gastronomy &amp; ease</h3>
        <p>
          Excellent restaurants, strong local produce, and a pace of life that
          still leaves room to think. A rare combination in Europe.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="/living-in-andorra" class="text-link">Read about living here</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Start with the facts</h2>
      <p>
        Residency, housing and professional help should begin with official
        sources and named firms — not rumour.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Residency</div>
        <h3>Become a resident</h3>
        <p>
          How the official permit types are organised, with links to Govern.ad
          and no invented figures.
        </p>
        <a href="/become-a-resident" class="text-link">Read the guide</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Directory</div>
        <h3>Trusted introductions</h3>
        <p>
          Banks, counsel, estate agents, clinics and a school — each with its
          official website.
        </p>
        <a href="/directory" class="text-link">Open the directory</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Parishes</div>
        <h3>Seven communes</h3>
        <p>
          A short portrait of each parish, from the capital to the high valleys,
          with the official Comú site.
        </p>
        <a href="/parishes" class="text-link">Explore the parishes</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Properties</div>
        <h3>How we list homes</h3>
        <p>
          A template only — no invented houses or borrowed photographs — plus
          AGIA-registered agents.
        </p>
        <a href="/properties" class="text-link">Read the structure</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="life">
    <div class="life-header">
      <h2>If you are actually moving</h2>
      <p>
        High-intent notes from official pages: country of departure, banks,
        a non-resident purchase, and the Government’s D.3 text.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Relocation</div>
        <h3>Moving to Andorra</h3>
        <p>UK, Spain and France — same Andorran file, different documents.</p>
        <a href="/moving-to-andorra" class="text-link">Start here</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Banking</div>
        <h3>Open an account</h3>
        <p>KYC, no online onboarding, AFA supervision, three named banks.</p>
        <a href="/opening-a-bank-account" class="text-link">Read the FAQ note</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Property</div>
        <h3>Buy as a non-resident</h3>
        <p>Foreign-investment authorisation, AGIA agents, no invented prices.</p>
        <a href="/buying-property" class="text-link">Read the rules</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">D.3</div>
        <h3>Digital nomad</h3>
        <p>The Government’s own page, without brochure income figures.</p>
        <a href="/digital-nomad" class="text-link">Read D.3</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Permit types people actually search</h2>
      <p>
        More official pages, still in English, still without invented
        deposits or tax rates.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">D.1</div>
        <h3>Residence without work</h3>
        <p>
          Named subtypes, 90-day presence, income as a multiple of the
          minimum wage.
        </p>
        <a href="/residence-without-work" class="text-link">Read D.1</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">B.1</div>
        <h3>Family reunification</h3>
        <p>Who the Government lists, and the household means test.</p>
        <a href="/family-reunification" class="text-link">Read B.1</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Tax</div>
        <h3>Tax residence</h3>
        <p>Article 8 of Law 5/2014 — 183 days, not your D.1 diary.</p>
        <a href="/tax-residence" class="text-link">Read the FAQ note</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">J.1 / D.4</div>
        <h3>Work on your own account</h3>
        <p>
          Self-employed residence and work, and the entrepreneur-programme
          page.
        </p>
        <a href="/self-employed-residence" class="text-link">Read J.1</a>
        &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <a href="/entrepreneur-residence" class="text-link">Read D.4</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
